# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-dev
dist-ssr
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/*
!.idea/.gitignore
!.idea/vcs.xml
# The Gradle build lives in src-kitsune/, not the project root, so IntelliJ can
# only find it through gradle.xml. Nothing in it is machine-specific ($PROJECT_DIR$
# paths, and the JVM is whatever the project SDK is), so it is tracked — without
# it a fresh clone opens with no Gradle project at all.
!.idea/gradle.xml
# IntelliJ generated module metadata is machine-specific (absolute paths, JDK
# names) and is regenerated from Gradle on import — never version-control it.
*.iml
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
